{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/pulls/7756","id":124751086,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0MTI0NzUxMDg2","html_url":"https://github.com/sequelize/sequelize/pull/7756","diff_url":"https://github.com/sequelize/sequelize/pull/7756.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sequelize/sequelize/pull/7756.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sequelize/sequelize/issues/7756","number":7756,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"ConnectionManager.close not closing database connection completely ","user":{"login":"nrschultz","id":463157,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MzE1Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/463157?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrschultz","html_url":"https://github.com/nrschultz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrschultz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrschultz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrschultz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrschultz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrschultz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrschultz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrschultz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrschultz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrschultz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Pull Request check-list\r\n\r\n- [X] Does `npm run test` or `npm run test-DIALECT` pass with this change (including linting)?\r\n- [X] Does your issue contain a link to existing issue (Closes #[issue]) or a description of the issue you are solving?\r\n- [x] Have you added new tests to prevent regressions?\r\n- [X] Is a documentation update included (if this change modifies existing APIs, or introduces new ones)? \r\n- [X] Have you added an entry under `Future` in the changelog?\r\n\r\n### Description of change\r\n\r\ncloses https://github.com/sequelize/sequelize/issues/7751\r\n\r\nAs mentioned in https://github.com/sequelize/sequelize/issues/7751, db.close() was not doing what it was supposed to.  It looks like during the `generic-pool` library upgrade the pool.drain() implementation was changed from taking a callback to returning a promise (https://github.com/coopernurse/node-pool/blob/master/lib/Pool.js#L481), but the sequelize code was not updated.  Because of that, the function being passed as a callback was never being called.  Adding a `.then` with the same function seems to fix the problem.\r\n\r\nI didn't go looking for other `generic-pool` callbacks that may have this same issue.\r\n\r\nI'm also not quite sure of the best way to test this change, some insight would be appreciated.","created_at":"2017-06-08T21:43:33Z","updated_at":"2017-06-12T11:47:42Z","closed_at":"2017-06-11T16:28:57Z","merged_at":"2017-06-11T16:28:57Z","merge_commit_sha":"e239a04da62f7fa5bb127743e67da5ff0f80b756","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"sushantdhiman","id":9989487,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5ODk0ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9989487?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman","html_url":"https://github.com/sushantdhiman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantdhiman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_ty